<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia falls to 1.769 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia falls to 1.769 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia has fallen to 1.769 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange - 1.760 at the previous session</p>
<p>				    October 7	    October 4</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.769		  1.760</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $11.90 mln	   $14.47 mln</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
